# --- Repo hygiene: generated media does not belong in git -------------------
# 113 tracked videos (757 MB) and ~250 MB of unused public/ imagery made every
# push take many minutes and, once LFS-tracked, broke the Vercel build (Vercel
# does not fetch LFS objects, so each file checked out as a 131-byte pointer).
# These stay on disk locally; they are just no longer version-controlled.
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.mov
*.MOV

# Campaign / generated asset folders under public that the app never serves.
# public/hero and public/tutorials ARE served and remain tracked.
public/ESP/
public/Fathopes_heroes_animated/
public/Fathopes-singapore/
public/threads-refs/
public/Poster Templates References/
public/Ai photos and videos to put in system/
